  "body": "If a worker gets sufficiently behind that there are more than 10000 updates for it to catch up on, the master drops the replication connection, and there is no way for it to catch up again.\r\n\r\nThe master reports `Exception: stream <stream> has fallen behind`.\r\n\r\nRelated: https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/issues/4388.",
